# Test: the VRRP config-sanity doctor check fires (spec-vrrp-5 AC-10).
#
# VALIDATES: `ze doctor --json` reports exactly what a commit would reject, with
# the code whose remediation fits: a cross-leaf violation gets
# doctor-vrrp-config-invalid, while a VPP-backed tree gets
# doctor-vrrp-backend-unusable (different fix: change the backend or drop the
# config). Both exit 1, because a fired SeverityError diagnostic makes
# `ze doctor` exit non-zero.
# PREVENTS: a doctor check that drifts from the verifier -- it re-runs the
# verifier, so `ze doctor` and a commit can never disagree -- and a single
# catch-all code that tells an operator nothing about which fix to apply.
#
# Split from vrrp-doctor.ci (the explain surface + the healthy-config case)
# because `expect=exit:code=` is file-level in this runner: those commands exit
# 0, these exit 1.

# --- A cross-leaf violation the YANG grammar cannot catch: accept-mode is a ---
# VRRPv3 feature (RFC 9568 Section 6.1) and cannot be combined with version 2.
tmpfs=vrrp-bad.conf:terminator=EOF_BAD
interface {
    backend netlink;
    ethernet eth0 {
        unit 0 {
            ipv4 {
                vrrp {
                    group bad {
                        vrid 10;
                        version 2;
                        accept-mode true;
                        virtual-address [ 192.0.2.1 ];
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
EOF_BAD

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze doctor --json vrrp-bad.conf:timeout=60s:exit=1
expect=exit:code=1
expect=stdout:contains=doctor-vrrp-config-invalid
expect=stdout:contains=accept-mode

# --- A VPP-backed tree: VRRP needs macvlan devices and raw sockets, which only -
# the netlink backend provides. Fail closed with the backend-specific code.
tmpfs=vrrp-vpp.conf:terminator=EOF_VPP
interface {
    backend vpp;
    ethernet eth0 {
        unit 0 {
            ipv4 {
                vrrp {
                    group any {
                        vrid 10;
                        virtual-address [ 192.0.2.1 ];
                    }
                }
            }
        }
    }
}
EOF_VPP

cmd=foreground:seq=2:exec=ze doctor --json vrrp-vpp.conf:exit=1
expect=exit:code=1
expect=stdout:contains=doctor-vrrp-backend-unusable
